n_Icon.webp/25px-Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Action_Surge_(Condition)\" title=\"Action Surge (Condition)\">Action Surge</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Legendary_Action:_Devoted_Galvanism\">Sources of Legendary Action: Devoted Galvanism</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Devoted_Galvanism\" title=\"Legendary Action: Devoted Galvanism\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Devoted Galvanism\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Legendary_Action_Galvanise_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Devoted_Galvanism\" title=\"Legendary Action: Devoted Galvanism\">Legendary Action: Devoted Galvanism</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062412\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 166